.83 0 0 1 3.9,12.64 Z M 4.1,11.9 L 2.29,9.76 A 0.83,0.83 0 0 1 3.54,8.69 L 5.36,10.83 A 0.83,0.83 0 0 1 4.1,11.9 Z M 2.2,8.81 L 4.34,5.11 A 0.83,0.83 0 0 1 5.77,5.93 L 3.63,9.63 A 0.83,0.83 0 0 1 2.2,8.81 Z M 5.2,4.71 L 7.96,5.21 A 0.83,0.83 0 0 1 7.67,6.83 L 4.91,6.33 A 0.83,0.83 0 0 1 5.2,4.71 Z M 7.4,5.31 L 8.5,4.67 A 0.83,0.83 0 0 1 9.33,6.1 L 8.23,6.73 A 0.83,0.83 0 0 1 7.4,5.31 Z M 12,8.28 A 3.72,3.72 0 1 1 12,15.73 A 3.72,3.72 0 1 1 12,8.28 Z M 12,9.93 A 2.08,2.08 0 1 0 12,14.08 A 2.08,2.08 0 1 0 12,9.93 Z" />
